ins</surname><given-names>GN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Management of acute urinary retention secondary to benign prostatic hyperplasia in the UK: A national survey</article-title><source>BJU Int</source><year>2004</year><volume>93</volume><fpage>84</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14678374</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT25"><label>25</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Desgrandchamps</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>De la Taille</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Doublet JD; RetenFrance Study</surname><given-names>Group</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Management of acute urinary retention in France: A cross-sectional survey in 2618 men with benign prostatic hyperplasia</article-title><source>BJU Int</source><year>2006</year><volume>97</volume><fpage>727</fpage><lpage>33</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16536763</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT26"><label>26</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Horgan</surname><given-names>AF</given-names></name><name><surname>Prasad</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Waldron</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Sullivan</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acute urinary retention: Comparison of suprapubic and urethral catheterization</article-title><source>Br J Urol</source><year>1992</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>149</fpage><lpage>51</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1393437</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT27"><label>27</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Patel</surname><given-names>MI</given-names></name><name><surname>Watts</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Gra